sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant AppHub as AppHub (API Server)
    participant GameHub as GameHub (Game Server)
    participant R as Message Broker (Redis)

    Note over C, AppHub: 1. Lobby Phase (Phòng Chờ)
    C->>AppHub: Connect WebSocket (kèm JWT Token)
    C->>AppHub: Create/Join Room (REST)
    AppHub-->>C: Trả về chi tiết phòng
    
    C->>AppHub: SetReadyStatus(true)
    AppHub-->>C: RoomReadyStatusChanged (Broadcast)
    
    Note over C, AppHub: 2. Handover Phase (Chuyển giao)
    C->>AppHub: StartRoomMatch(roomCode)
    AppHub->>R: StartMatchRequestedEvent
    R-->>GameHub: Nhận thông tin, khởi tạo Bàn chơi
    
    AppHub-->>C: RoomMatchStarting (Chứa wsUrl & wsAccessToken)
    
    C->>GameHub: Connect WebSocket (kèm wsAccessToken)
    C->>GameHub: SignalR Handshake {"protocol":"json","version":1}
    GameHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "Connected")
    GameHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "StateSnapshot")
    
    Note over C, GameHub: 3. Gameplay Phase (Vận hành)
    C->>GameHub: SendCommand(PlayCard, cardCode: "Skip")
    GameHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "Ack", stateVersion)
    GameHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "GameplayEvent")
    GameHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "StateSnapshot")

    C->>GameHub: SendCommand(DrawCard)
    GameHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "Ack")
    GameHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "StateSnapshot")
    
    Note over GameHub, AppHub: 4. Conclusion Phase (Kết thúc)
    GameHub->>R: MatchEndedIntegrationEvent
    R-->>AppHub: Tính XP, cộng Elo Score, lưu vào Database
    AppHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "MatchEnded")
    C->>GameHub: (Client tự động ngắt kết nối Game Server)
    AppHub-->>C: ReceiveMessage (event: "ReturnedToRoom")
